{"id":158,"slug":"documentation","title":"Kamailio Documentation","date":"2010-03-07T00:45:31","url":"https://www.kamailio.org/w/documentation/","html":"<p><em>Project developers do the best to provide good and up-to-date documentation. However, as time is an important and limited resource, we welcome all of you to contribute. Anyone has access to wiki portals on both Kamailio<sup>®</sup> and SIP Router sites, feel free to enrich the existing content and add new docs.</em></p>\n<p><em>Following sections provide an index to projects&#8217; documentation resources.<br />\n</em></p>\n<p><em><strong>Kamailio Modules:</strong></em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://kamailio.org/docs/modules/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.kamailio.org/docs/modules/</a></li>\n<li>[<a href=\"https://kamailio.org/docs/modules/6.0.x\">6.0.x</a>] [<a href=\"https://kamailio.org/docs/modules/6.1.x\">6.1.x</a>] [<a href=\"https://kamailio.org/docs/modules/devel/\">devel</a>]</li>\n<li>[<a href=\"https://kamailio.org/docs/modules/5.0.x\">5.0.x</a>] [<a href=\"https://kamailio.org/docs/modules/5.1.x\">5.1.x</a>] [<a href=\"https://kamailio.org/docs/modules/5.2.x\">5.2.x</a>] [<a href=\"https://kamailio.org/docs/modules/5.3.x\">5.3.x</a>] [<a href=\"https://kamailio.org/docs/modules/5.4.x\">5.4.x</a>] [<a href=\"https://kamailio.org/docs/modules/5.5.x\">5.5.x</a>] [<a href=\"https://kamailio.org/docs/modules/5.6.x\">5.6.x</a>] [<a href=\"https://kamailio.org/docs/modules/5.7.x\">5.7.x</a>] [<a href=\"https://kamailio.org/docs/modules/5.8.x\">5.8.x</a>]</li>\n<li>[<a href=\"https://kamailio.org/docs/modules/4.0.x\">4.0.x</a>] [<a href=\"https://kamailio.org/docs/modules/4.1.x\">4.1.x</a>] [<a href=\"https://kamailio.org/docs/modules/4.2.x\">4.2.x</a>] [<a href=\"https://kamailio.org/docs/modules/4.3.x\">4.3.x</a>] [<a href=\"https://kamailio.org/docs/modules/4.4.x\">4.4.x</a>]</li>\n<li>[<a href=\"https://kamailio.org/docs/modules/3.0.x\">3.0.x</a>] [<a href=\"https://ka